{"step_index":10655,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-25T21:31:05Z","thinking":"A database write lock is defined within the pipeline script, ensuring thread safety during database operations. This locking mechanism protects against concurrent write access, encapsulating connection acquisition, execution of a write function, transaction management (commit/rollback), and connection closure. This pattern is applied within the idea generation process, where a database insertion function leverages this locking mechanism to maintain data integrity.\n\n\nProcessing the idea data to prepare for insertion into the database. Filtering out ideas without titles. Attempting to insert a maximum of ten ideas per processing cycle. After insertion of idea data, related element data is also added.\n\n\nConstructing database insertion operations for video prompts and SEO metadata. Video prompts are being formulated based on a specific escalation level, incorporating a predefined rule. SEO data includes title, description, tags, category, and language fields.\n\n\nForming SEO metadata insertion queries. These include fields like the category and language. Building an SEO run record with scores for demand, novelty, saturation, and opportunity based on extracted tags. Then, inserting SEO keyword metrics associated with the run, attributing random search volume and predefined competition/CPC values to each tag.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"replace_file_content","args":{"AllowMultiple":"false","Description":"\"Add db_write_lock and execute_db_write helper to ensure thread-safe transactions\"","EndLine":"75","Instruction":"\"Add db_write_lock and execute_db_write helper\"","ReplacementContent":"\"progress_lock = threading.RLock()\\ndb_write_lock = threading.Lock()\\n\\ndef get_db_connection():\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"Create a thread-safe connection to the SQLite database.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    conn = sqlite3.connect(DB_PATH, timeout=60.0)\\n    conn.execute(\\\"PRAGMA journal_mode=WAL;\\\")\\n    conn.execute(\\\"PRAGMA busy_timeout=60000;\\\")\\n    conn.create_function(\\\"gate_auth_verify\\\", 0, lambda: 1)\\n    return conn\\n\\ndef execute_db_write(write_fn):\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"Safely execute a write transaction with mutual exclusion and guaranteed close.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    with db_write_lock:\\n        conn = get_db_connection()\\n        try:\\n            res = write_fn(conn)\\n            conn.commit()\\n            return res\\n        except Exception:\\n            conn.rollback()\\n            raise\\n        finally:\\n            conn.close()\"","StartLine":"58","TargetContent":"\"progress_lock = threading.RLock()\\n\\ndef get_db_connection():\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"Create a thread-safe connection to the SQLite database.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    conn = sqlite3.connect(DB_PATH, timeout=60.0)\\n    conn.execute(\\\"PRAGMA journal_mode=WAL;\\\")\\n    conn.execute(\\\"PRAGMA busy_timeout=60000;\\\")\\n    conn.create_function(\\\"gate_auth_verify\\\", 0, lambda: 1)\\n    return conn\"","TargetFile":"\"/home/azureuser/.openclaw/workspace/IROSCRIPT-CEO/social-media/youtube/Youtube Automation/PromptDatabase/run_cluster_pipeline.py\"","toolAction":"\"Adding db_write_lock and execute_db_write\"","toolSummary":"\"Add db_write_lock in run_cluster_pipeline.py\""}}]}
